**/*.rs.bk
.pir/

# Worktrees live inside the main checkout by default (`git worktree add`), and
# each is a full checkout of its own. Never commit them: `git add -A` at the repo
# root will otherwise sweep one in as an embedded repository.
/.worktrees/

# Upstream facebook/watchman checkout, kept only as a reference for the ported
# tests and expression-language semantics. 51 MB, its own git repo: reference
# material, not part of this project, never committed.
/watchman/
